pphire":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"onyx":"TABLE","pearl":"quartz","quartz":"sapphire","ruby":"TABLE","sapphire":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"onyx":"ruby","pearl":"quartz","quartz":"sapphire","ruby":"TABLE","sapphire":"TABLE"},"legal":true}],"valid":true}}
{"challenge_axes":[],"difficulty":1,"generation_seed":20261009,"generator_version":"1.3.2","oracle_version":"independent-1.0.0","record_hash":"b20b03c5f12bc2ac90aed11ade9bac074a935f74c4e3d71d864db672dab8b2c7","rendered_input":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"graph\",\"nodes\":[\"Dune\",\"Aster\",\"Beryl\"],\"edges\":[[\"Dune\",\"Aster\",3],[\"Aster\",\"Beryl\",3],[\"Aster\",\"Dune\",5]],\"start\":\"Dune\",\"goal\":\"Dune\",\"fuel\":6,\"plan\":[]}","renderer":"forward","review_receipt_ids":["expert-RGM-001-expansion-